 "_doc": "Director motion data (rr-38), humanoid rig v2 for the Chainbound Gaoler on the mq-15 maquette and the owner-approved mq3 paintings (unchanged: the fitted clay sits on them). Same binding semantics as rr-10 (held item, angle_deg, release_at), rr-35 and rr-37. chain.angle_deg rotates the chain about the grip; positive swings the hanging hook toward the facing's forward (the hook leads), so the cast in reel is the hook flung out toward the target. Action leans stay within the spec's 4 degrees.",
